   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. comprehensive database in identifying the suitable implementations of SDGs 10 &amp; 16 localisation in addressing the stateless and undocumented persons in Sabah
2. recommendations under SDGs 8, 10 &amp; 16 based on the findings of Output 1.1
3. Implementation of a pilot project which then can be used for knowledge exchange based on SDGs 8, 10 &amp; 16</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. 0 comprehensive database
2. 0 recommendations 
3. 0 pilot implemented</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. 1 comprehensive database profiling the different undocumented and stateless communities in Sabah (Continuation for Phase 3 from 2019). 
2. 3 recommendations based on the findings
3. 2 pilots based on the findings
Please note that the survey from Phase 3 had to put on hold due to COVID19 and the Movement Control Order</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Completed 1 comprehensive database profiling the different undocumented and stateless communities in Sabah (Continuation for Phase 3 from 2019). 
2. 3 recommendations based on the findings - done
3. 2 pilots based on the findings - proposals were developed

Please note that the survey from Phase 3 had to put on hold due to COVID19 and the Movement Control Order. Survey completed by 31 Dec 2020</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Final Report to be submitted
2. High level policy recommendations to be submitted to UNCT.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">A UNCT meeting was organized in June to share initial findings of the consolidation report. The baseline assessment on the undocumented and stateless people in Sabah state is near completion.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
